    <h1>Looking for a Poon Hill Alternative? Kokhe Danda vs Poon Hill</h1>
    <p class="kh-hero-sub">The same Annapurna and Dhaulagiri views, without the crowds. Here is how the two short treks from Pokhara compare.</p>
